cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use CellScoper in your research, please cite it as below.
title: CellScoper
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Zhou
    given-names: Tianrui
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/zhoutianrui-tongji/CellScoper"
date-released: 2026-11-18
abstract: >-
  CellScoper finds subcellular structures in segmented cells from transcript positions alone, labels known structures
  with built-in validation against held-out reference markers, and reports per-cell structure amounts for
  subcellular-resolution spatial transcriptomics (Xenium, Atera, CosMx).
keywords:
  - spatial transcriptomics
  - subcellular RNA localization
  - imaging-based spatial transcriptomics
  - representation learning
